WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,380
Sister Fei, you really borrowed it

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:04,100
It's not borrowed, it's exchanged for work

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,260
What did Su Che ask you to do?

4
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:06,970
Qingjijuan

5
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:10,140
What if you really did it?

6
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:12,500
What you are surrounding now is not my seduction trophy.

7
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,620
It's the Suzhou car that I exchanged for my production machine.

8
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,380
People actually follow rules.

9
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:18,620
Don't send her a good guy card

10
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:20,820
She just knows everything about Bai Tiantian

11
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:25,610
Call Xu Wei over, Sister Xue Ya, come to me

12
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:29,270
Still dare to come

13
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:30,790
Just because of your false information

14
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:32,800
I just swallowed a pack of facial mask for free.

15
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,970
How supportive is that thing on the island?

16
00:00:35,090 --> 00:00:38,410
I heard it wrong too. Stop talking nonsense. I’ll give you another chance.

17
00:00:38,410 --> 00:00:39,690
Wu Ruixi's sanitary products

18
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:41,610
Did Su Che give it to me?

19
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:42,610
I don't care if you use a sword

20
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:43,930
Use exchange or cheat

21
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:44,930
Bring me a copy

22
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:45,890
Done

23
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:47,570
The previous account has been written off.

24
00:00:47,570 --> 00:00:48,570
Give you the mask

25
00:00:48,570 --> 00:00:50,010
I don't want to steal other people's things

26
00:00:50,610 --> 00:00:51,650
It’s okay not to do it

27
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:53,290
I will tell Zhang Feifei now

28
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:54,690
You've been sending me messages

29
00:00:57,010 --> 00:00:59,660
Then take care of things and make a deposit
